	(text "BugBot Final - Odometry Board, root sheet\nFloor-facing board under the Motion board: PMW3360 optical flow (SPI) and BNO055 IMU (I2C),\n1.9 V LDO for the sensor core, GH10 cable to the Motion board's J7. Motion outline and holes.\nPower links are drawn; the cable signals join by label." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25 30 0)
